From 03085fb5fed29ea8225336ecdcc842988b03aef9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aarushi03 <suzy20159@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:21:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support a profile photo in the home page circle

---
 README.md         | 5 +++--
 assets/styles.css | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5d8c6da..1998102 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -29,8 +29,9 @@ scripts/                   setup, preview, update and custom-domain helpers
 3. **Facts to double-check:** the paper summaries on `publications/index.html`, and the prancSTR install
    commands and GitHub links on `tools/index.html`.
 4. **Optional photo.** The round mosaic on the home page stands in for a photo. To use yours, put
-   `profile.jpg` in `assets/` and replace the `<div class="avatar" …>…</div>` block in `index.html` with
-   `<div class="avatar" style="padding:0"><img src="assets/profile.jpg" alt="Aarushi Sehgal"></div>`.
+   `profile.jpg` in `assets/` and replace the `<div class="avatar" …>…</div>` line in `index.html` with
+   `<div class="avatar photo"><img src="assets/profile.jpg" alt="Aarushi Sehgal"></div>`.
+   A roughly square photo of at least 600 × 600 pixels and under 300 KB works best.
 
 ## Publish
 
diff --git a/assets/styles.css b/assets/styles.css
index 271c493..0ee7ada 100644
--- a/assets/styles.css
+++ b/assets/styles.css
@@ -112,6 +112,8 @@ main { min-height: 60vh; }
 .avatar i.a { background: var(--mosaic-a); }
 .avatar i.h { background: var(--mosaic-h); }
 .avatar img { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 1 / -1; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
+.avatar.photo { display: block; padding: 0; }
+.avatar.photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 30%; }
 @media (max-width: 760px) {
   .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding-top: 2.5rem; }
   .avatar { order: -1; width: 140px; padding: 9px; gap: 2px; }
-- 
2.43.0

